  "_note": "AT89C2051 8051-core MCU. Pin table audited against Atmel/Microchip AT89C2051 datasheet (doc0368). DIP-20 package. 2 KB flash, 128 B RAM, 15 I/O lines. Ports P1 (P1.0-P1.7) and P3 (P3.0-P3.5, P3.7; P3.6 not bonded). RST = active-high reset. XTAL1/XTAL2 = crystal oscillator. P3.0/P3.1 = UART RXD/TXD. P3.2/P3.3 = INT0/INT1. P3.4/P3.5 = T0/T1. P1.0/P1.1 = analog comparator inputs AIN0/AIN1. Terminal names use p3_0 format (underscore for 8051-style P3.0 dot notation). Chip emulator config (emu8051) comes separately — do NOT block on it.",
